example.desc.grade=Warmer highlights, slightly cooler shadows and a gentle contrast curve over the finished picture.
example.desc.translucency=The sun behind a leaf or a small plant lights it from the back.
example.desc.transmission=How much sunlight comes through a leaf. Changes without a rebuild.
example.desc.grade_strength=How much of the grade is applied. Changes without a rebuild.
example.desc.bloom=A glow round bright things, from Radiante's bloom pyramid. Higher is a stronger glow. Changes without a rebuild.
example.desc.lens=Ghosts of bright lights mirrored through the centre and colour fringes towards the edges. Changes without a rebuild.
